        "Migrates all current hardcoded INCIDENT_KEYWORDS into explicit strong/supporting/alert-only treatment."
      ],
      "limitations": "This is code provenance, not an official event taxonomy."
    },
    {
      "id": "curated-indonesian-seed",
      "kind": "curated_phrase_expansion",
      "publisher": "Waspada Jakarta development seed",
      "supports": [
        "Supplemental Indonesian phrases for violence, transport, utility, crowd, maritime, health and infrastructure events."
